        <h2>A Foundation in Dynamic Body Balancing</h2>
        <p>Dynamic Body Balancing is a multi-level educational approach that integrates the study of fascia, cranial anatomy, gentle bodywork, and body awareness.</p>
        <p>Our training introduces techniques for working with the body as an interconnected system. The broader program also includes specialized study in pregnancy, birth, and pediatric applications.</p>
        <p>Our approach is grounded in the techniques we have studied and practiced, with an emphasis on gentleness, individual comfort, and respect for each person's experience.</p>
